  together in i think it was about three  weeks  and i at that moment i mean i remember  those three weeks were obviously really  busy and i thought that would be the  hardest thing that i'd ever have to do  in my professional life and it turned  out that that's probably the easiest  thing i've had to do  in the six months or so that i've had  the job

